# Title: Non-privileged Usage of Reg or Powershell
# ID: 8f02c935-effe-45b3-8fc9-ef8696a9e41d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Ryan Plas (rule), oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-05
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Search for usage of reg or Powershell by non-privileged users to modify service configuration in registry
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*reg * AND process.command_line:*add*)) OR ((process.command_line:*powershell* OR process.command_line:*set-itemproperty* OR process.command_line:* sp * OR process.command_line:*new-itemproperty*))) AND ((IntegrityLevel:"Medium" OR IntegrityLevel:"S-1-16-8192") AND (process.command_line:*ControlSet* AND process.command_line:*Services*) AND (process.command_line:*ImagePath* OR process.command_line:*FailureCommand* OR process.command_line:*ServiceDLL*)))
